# Purpose....: Example environment configuration for oracle-free-labs
# Notes......: Copy to .env and adjust settings as needed.
#              Provides defaults for Oracle Free 23ai container services.
#
# Reference..: https://github.com/oehrlis/oracle-free23-ealab
